x-emulators (0~git20260129.40dfef0d-1foundry1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Packages LGB's Xemu ("X-Emulators") suite from
    https://github.com/lgblgblgb/xemu at master commit 40dfef0d (upstream
    publishes no tags or releases, hence the git-snapshot version).
  * Ships seven emulators: xc65, xmega65, xclcd, xvic20, xep128, xprimo,
    xtvc. No ROMs are bundled.
  * Named x-emulators, not xemu: the name "xemu" is already taken in this
    repo by the unrelated original Xbox emulator (https://xemu.app). This
    follows the same precedent as asar -> asar-snes-assembler.
  * Hardening flags are appended to the generated build config rather than
    passed on the make command line, which would clobber upstream's CFLAGS.

 -- Foundry Linux <packages@foundrylinux.org>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 09:00:00 +0700
